## Tic-Tac-Toe
// Two players take turns, X then O, putting their mark in an empty square.
// Three in a row, across, down or corner to corner, wins;  nine marks and no row is a draw.
// What's where, top to bottom:
//   a square, and the board:  nine squares in a grid
//   the game:  whose turn it is, the rules for a win, and its drawing
//   start
//   tests


## A square:  empty, or holding an X or an O
a "square" is a drawable thing where:
	- its "mark" is text
	- it "is empty" if its mark is ""

	// a click plays it:  the game says whether it can
	- to draw it:
		return <button part="mark" onClick={play it}>{its mark}</button>

## The board:  nine squares, three a row -- styles.css lays them out
a "board" is a drawable list of squares

// a square is on one board
a square belongs to one board


## The game
tic tac toe is an app where:
	- its "board" is a new board
	// whose turn it is:  X or O
	- its "turn" is text
	// who won:  X, O, "nobody" for a draw, or "" while the game goes on
	- its "winner" is text
	- it "is over" if its winner is not ""

	// what the line above the board says
	- its "message" is:
		its turn + " to play" if its winner is ""
		"A draw" if its winner is "nobody"
		its winner + " wins!" otherwise

	// nine squares, made with the game
	// - inside the loop `it` is the count:  so the board is `the board of tic tac toe`
	- to create it:
		repeat 9 times
			add a new square to the board of tic tac toe

	// an empty board, X to play
	- to start a new game:
		for each square in its board
			set the mark of the square to ""
		set its turn to "X"
		set its winner to ""

	// the same mark in all three squares wins
	- to check the line from square (a as a number) through (b as a number) to (c as a number):
		set mark to the mark of square a of its board
		if mark is "" return
		if the mark of square b of its board is mark and the mark of square c of its board is mark
			set its winner to mark

	// three in a row:  each row, each column, and the two diagonals
	- to check for a winner:
		check the line from square 1 through 2 to 3
		check the line from square 4 through 5 to 6
		check the line from square 7 through 8 to 9
		check the line from square 1 through 4 to 7
		check the line from square 2 through 5 to 8
		check the line from square 3 through 6 to 9
		check the line from square 1 through 5 to 9
		check the line from square 3 through 5 to 7
		if its winner is "" and its board has no squares where it is empty
			set its winner to "nobody"

	// the message, the board, then a button for a new game
	- to draw it:
		return <div class="TicTacToe">
			<h2 class="Message">{its message}</h2>
			{draw its board}
			<ui-button primary onClick={start a new game}>New game</ui-button>
		</div>


## Playing a square:  the turn's mark, if the square is empty and nobody has won
to play (a square):
	if tic tac toe is over or the square is not empty return
	set the mark of the square to the turn of tic tac toe
	check for a winner
	set the turn of tic tac toe to "O" if the turn of tic tac toe is "X" otherwise "X"


## Start
start a new game
start tic tac toe


## Tests
to test three in a row
	start a new game
	play square 1 of the board of tic tac toe
	play square 4 of the board of tic tac toe
	play square 2 of the board of tic tac toe
	play square 5 of the board of tic tac toe
	play square 3 of the board of tic tac toe
	the winner of tic tac toe should be "X"
	the message of tic tac toe should be "X wins!"
	start a new game
